{"availability":"available","full":"hunter-read/grimoire","name":"grimoire","description":"Self-hosted organizer for your TTRPG content and campaigns","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":287,"forks":19,"created":"2026-04-06T19:58:05Z","updated":"2026-10-09T14:52:31Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://grimoirecodex.org","topics":[],"demo":"https://demo.grimoirecodex.org/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:35.016Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:35.016Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:35.016Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:35.016Z","stars":287,"forks":19}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Website · Documentation · Live Demo · Join our Discord","A self-hosted web app for your tabletop RPG library. Point it at a folder of PDFs, maps, tokens, audio, and 3D models, and Grimoire turns it into a searchable library you can read from any device - every page of every book indexed, including scanned ones.","It runs as a single Docker container against a directory you already own, and by default never writes to it."],"features":["Library browser - Organizes your collection by game system from the folder structure, with card, compact, and list layouts.","Full-text search - Every page of every PDF is indexed with SQLite FTS5. Also finds books by title, author, or publisher, and maps, tokens, audio, and models by filename, folder, or tag. Narrow with title:, author:, tag:…","Sort, filter, and saved presets - Filter on genre, system family, edition, dice/materials, tags, favourites, and explicit content. Tag filters are boolean groups (Building AND store OR shop), and named presets save to…","Shared tags - One tag catalog across every resource type, with a Tags page to rename, merge, delete, and browse by tag, and per-tag downloads.","Metadata editor - Rich metadata for systems and books, drawn from curated lists you manage in Settings → Metadata. Parent systems group related lines (\"Cyberpunk\" + \"Red\" → \"Cyberpunk Red\")."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hunter-read/grimoire/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"873fb3ec30b2a7e3569a371814092db9cd63e8ce27c3ffca6180da337750a312","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:35.168Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:35.168Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Website · Documentation · Live Demo · Join our Discord","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hunter-read/grimoire/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"On first launch you'll be prompted to create an admin account, or you can pre-seed users automatically (see Pre-seeding users).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hunter-read/grimoire/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"873fb3ec30b2a7e3569a371814092db9cd63e8ce27c3ffca6180da337750a312","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hunter-read/grimoire/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:35.168Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T14:52:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hunter-read/grimoire/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:35.169Z","hash":"873fb3ec30b2a7e3569a371814092db9cd63e8ce27c3ffca6180da337750a312","originalBytes":22905,"storedBytes":22905,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","docker","library","grimoire","images","page","see","token","audio","editor","maps","tag","campaign","metadata","system","compose","image","map","book","books","models","tokens","docker-compose.yml","file","folder","running","systems","character","data","every","files","one","run","search","view","what","wiki","api","browser","default","notes","pull","tags","themes","uvtt","who","app","campaigns","community","guide","latest","license","own","page.png","path","sheets","slim","admin","already","any","bash","browse","database","documentation","each","edit","export","favourites","hunterreadca","including","install","it.","live","new","ocr","pdfs","pe